 "notes": "Own row lists no pool, pit or grave. SWP Mukhmas (Mem III p. 12) describes the village of Mukhmas, not the unit (a settlement in the wadi); its directions are from the village, so relative_to other. SWP Mugharet el Jai (Mem III p. 6; printed pp. 137-141) is in Wadi Suweinit (unit other name); its directions are from the cave or wadi (relative_to other); the text stops mid-word at 12,000 characters. The cistern \"at Khurbet et Tineh\" may be WBADB Kh. et-Tinat (E367/S2565) but the packet does not say so: position none. SWP \"Khurbet el Mahmeh\" (Mem III p. 119, square Ls, 12 km, different name) is clearly another place: ignored. Mukhmas p. 149 and Suwan entries have no features. Sheikh's tombs dated L (Muslim saint's tomb). S2442 troughs, S2542/S2614 cupmarks, S2631 rock-cut installations not coded."
